mutation log a successful schedule or cancellation before committing storage
detects UpdateSuccessAfterSave
-    /\ phase = "updateResolved"
+    /\ phase \in {"update", "updateResolved"}

mutation associate cancellation with the post-update state
detects UpdateAssociation
-    /\ LET subject == IF request.action = "cancel" THEN request.before
+    /\ LET subject == IF request.action = "cancel" THEN request.after

mutation omit the old ID on schedule replacement
detects UpdateAssociation
-           prior == IF request.outcome = "replaced" THEN request.before.id ELSE 0
+           prior == 0

mutation associate a delivered event with the new queue after it has been closed
detects DeliveryAssociation
-                  !.reservationId = request.before.id, !.kind = request.kind,
+                  !.reservationId = request.after.id, !.kind = request.kind,

mutation omit the retry flag when planning a retry
detects DeliveryAssociation
-                  !.retry = request.kind \in request.after.pending]
+                  !.retry = FALSE]

mutation record an expired alarm as a provider success
detects DeliveryClassification
-    /\ audit' = [NoAudit EXCEPT !.action = "delivery", !.outcome = request.outcome,
+    /\ audit' = [NoAudit EXCEPT !.action = "delivery", !.outcome = IF request.outcome = "expired" THEN "provider_accepted" ELSE request.outcome,

mutation commit the delivered event before recording its provider result
detects DeliveryRecordedBeforeSave
-    /\ phase = "deliveryLogged"
+    /\ phase \in {"deliveryResult", "deliveryLogged"}
